Package: libseat-hwcomposer-shim
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libegl1
Description: libseat/DRM/EGL/HWC2 shims for phoc on FuriOS Mali/HWC2
 LD_PRELOAD shim providing: fake libseat API (O_NONBLOCK device opens),
 DRM capability patches, EGL visual-id fix, HWC2 vsync shim, and
 hwcomposer buffer count/fence shims.
 .
 Tested on Furiphone FLX1 (Dimensity 900, Mali-G68 MC4) running FuriOS.
